# <type>(<scope>): <subject>(#<issue>)
#
# Conventional Commits 提交信息模板 / Conventional Commits template
# 启用 / enable: git config commit.template .gitmessage
#
# type: feat | fix | docs | ci | refactor | test | chore
# scope（可选 / optional）: 影响范围 / affected scope，如 / e.g. config
# subject: 简洁描述，祈使语气，结尾不加句号 / concise, imperative mood, no trailing period
# issue: 关联 issue 编号 / related issue number，如 / e.g. (#96)
#
# 示例 / examples:
#   ci: 定时构建调整为北京时间 09:23(#82)
#   refactor(config): 硬编码治理——远程端点与魔法数字集中常量化(#94)
